    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Mega Bear",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113531208738365574780/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUBRLxQPjD0nbYd0WmOKhwbJvHBfmChCre-Wdp56XjTrQKZxG8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Very convenient place to stop for a short break or to feed a baby or use the washroom. There are changing rooms for the children that their father or mother may require that type of space to get the deed done. The person working there was very welcoming and pleasant when giving any information that you need for that shopping strip mall. This family area is always clean every time I have had to use it. It shows that Harden is thinking of the convenience of the shoppers that stop by to buy. It is located near the store, La Vie en Rose.  Thank you. It is appreciated.",
        "time": 1699556699,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Diego Andres Galeano Florez",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106048760777539240570/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWhFtoNUwWSnurGG4Qhz5B2DlK9l1Qij7-tVpqQVbPZFSm1MMY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Great space when you need to take a brake in your shopping day or when you need to change dippers to yours kids.",
        "time": 1557309112,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eric Blair",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118096829909210081568/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIUOiE8tPfkJ2MQcecJnX2Cp4tC641tQYCaHavfuX-i_F-yCA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Not a great experience!! My wife was shopping so I decided to go feed our 6 month old daughter and they refused to let me feed her there because I wasn't breastfeeding! Shame that if you're a dad by yourself for the day you have no place to go! Sitting in my vehicle now feeding my daughter, thanks for nothing!!!",
        "time": 1761221957,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Natasha Maltais",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104518745551820143561/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV84RKIkUMPYZwDxii6IEBuofwxRYW1djFghrMJnp_wvTLPsjn3=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Last friday (01/24/2020) my car was stuck in the parking lot and a kind employee named Gloria helped me call a towing truck. I was so grateful the service here is impeccable and the staff is helpful and incredibly friendly.",
        "time": 1580575229,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Goodtime",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106759412726052318006/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU7DaXHwnfIOAmS_CYbZpitKvC66K4bnPRQl_k1cbHv2wiQLDrl=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Gloria, the woman who works at the front desk was super sweet, my friends and I came inside and she offered us an amazing service and made our day! Thank you!",
